## Research Interests

My primary focus is on <b>Knowledge Graph Summarization</b>, utilizing both extractive and abstractive approaches. Nevertheless, I am open to collaboration in the following areas:

- Knowledge Graphs: Construction, Reasoning, and RAG. 
- Link Specification and Verbalization

For more details regarding my work, feel free to visit my GitHub at https://github.com/asep-fajar-firmansyah

